{
    "title": "Tangle Rope 3D: Untwist Knots",
    "description": "Looking for a way to unwind and exercise your mind during your leisure time? Look no further than Tangle Rope 3D: Untwist Knots puzzle game.\r\nWith the Tangle Rope 3D: Untwist Knots puzzle game, you will step into a 3D puzzle adventure.\r\n\r\nTangle Rope 3D: Untwist Knots is a puzzle game designed to test your problem-solving skills and help you improve your brain. The game presents a series of brain-teasing challenges involving ropes and lines, keeping you engrossed as you unravel each puzzle.\r\n\r\nYou will pass the level when you untangle all the knots and tap away all the ropes in time within the time limit\r\n\r\nHow to play Tangle Rope 3D: Untwist Knots\r\n- Choose your ropes wisely to avoid creating more knots.\r\n- Tap on the ropes to move and position them correctly, Untwist all the Knot\r\n- Arrange the ropes in the correct sequence.\r\n- Stay quick on your feet and strategize as you navigate the ropes to untangle the knots.\r\n- Successfully untie all the knots to emerge victorious.\r\n\r\nFeatures in Tangle Rope 3D: Untwist Knots\r\n- Immerse yourself in stunning 3D graphics and vibrant designs.\r\n- Conquer over 2000+ levels across various maps and difficulties.\r\n- Hone your problem-solving skills as you untangle ropes.\r\n\r\nAre you ready to dive into the entangled world of Tangle Rope 3D and tackle the tangled challenge? This game boasts stunning 3D graphics and a lively design, perfect for unwinding. With its responsive and versatile controls, you're in for an enjoyable gaming session.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Looking for a way to unwind and exercise your mind during your leisure time? Look no further than Tangle Rope 3D: Untwist Knots puzzle game.<br>With the Tangle Rope 3D: Untwist Knots puzzle game, you will step into a 3D puzzle adventure.<br><br>Tangle Rope 3D: Untwist Knots is a puzzle game designed to test your problem-solving skills and help you improve your brain. The game presents a series of brain-teasing challenges involving ropes and lines, keeping you engrossed as you unravel each puzzle.<br><br>You will pass the level when you untangle all the knots and tap away all the ropes in time within the time limit<br><br>How to play Tangle Rope 3D: Untwist Knots<br>- Choose your ropes wisely to avoid creating more knots.<br>- Tap on the ropes to move and position them correctly, Untwist all the Knot<br>- Arrange the ropes in the correct sequence.<br>- Stay quick on your feet and strategize as you navigate the ropes to untangle the knots.<br>- Successfully untie all the knots to emerge victorious.<br><br>Features in Tangle Rope 3D: Untwist Knots<br>- Immerse yourself in stunning 3D graphics and vibrant designs.<br>- Conquer over 2000+ levels across various maps and difficulties.<br>- Hone your problem-solving skills as you untangle ropes.<br><br>Are you ready to dive into the entangled world of Tangle Rope 3D and tackle the tangled challenge? This game boasts stunning 3D graphics and a lively design, perfect for unwinding. With its responsive and versatile controls, you&#39;re in for an enjoyable gaming session.",
